     ""\
     "<b>Capabilities:</b>"\
     "Canadians Access to M16A1s series, LAWs/M67s, M60, etc."\
     "Royal Marines Acces to FAL, GPMG, etc"\
     ""\
     "<b>MLCOA:</b>"\
     "Attack us from either directions, though likely not in sync or coordinated."\
     ""\
     "<b>MDCOA:</b>"\
     "Attack us at the same direction, splitting our forces up making it harder to defend."\
     ""\
     "<b>Defensive Fires:</b>"\
     "No known in-direct threat at this time."\
     ""\
     "<b>Airthreat:</b>"\
     "No known Air support."\
     ""\
     "<b>Morale:</b>"\
